Oxas, who also goes by Oxide and whom [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] call the professor lady, is an adjunct professor at the Arcanum of [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]]. She keeps an office in the city, walled with book stacks and a window that looks out over the interior, and it is shielded against teleportation. [[People/Althane/The Broker|The Broker]] comes and goes from it by a bookshelf that shimmers open when she makes the way for him.

After the [[People/Althane/The Crystalpoint Lattice|Crystalpoint Lattice]] was excised, Oxas was set over the [[Org/Althane/The Trust|Trust]] at [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]]'s word, the first head it had chosen for itself. She is power-hungry and used her new place at once to settle old scores, and her rule over the Trust is expected to be a bumpy one. She is the only person in the [[Org/Althane/The Network|Network]] who had met the Broker and knew his face, and she keeps her ties there while serving her own interests.

Oxas is an operative of [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]]. When the Weft reached Illyara strapped for cash, she hired them for his job against the professor [[People/Althane/Ashmont|Ashmont]]: steal his research and his key to the Arcanum's annex, then break into the annex for a golden needle about a foot long. The needle was gone, but they had done well enough that the Broker showed himself to them.
